    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66742" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετακύμιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῦμα</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>between the
				waves</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἄτας</span>
