			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μ.</span>
			<i>space between the waves</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				11.22
			</span></i> (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
